{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When journalism student, Cynthia Moriyama, reads about a ghost town only a couple hours away from her city, she can't help but gather her friend group to investigate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as disaster strikes, she finds herself alone in an unfamiliar and hostile place. With no combat experience and no way to escape, she is forced to delve deeper into the fog ridden town of Ivayami. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the fictional town of Ivayami, set in the brazilian mountains of Serra do Mar, solve puzzles, and hide from the creatures that dwell in the fog, as you try to rescue your friends and uncover the truth about the ghost town.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3337980?t=1757561086","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/d5d2ee424af73eb8215ff8b9004ecb31c67f407a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757561086","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/d6436782a8323800377f506efa5ba7a5c538f573/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757561086","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/d6436782a8323800377f506efa5ba7a5c538f573/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757561086","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When journalism student, Cynthia Moriyama, reads about a ghost town only a couple hours away from her city, she can't help but gather her friend group to investigate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as disaster strikes, she finds herself alone in an unfamiliar and hostile place. With no combat experience and no way to escape, she is forced to delve deeper into the fog ridden town of Ivayami. </p><p class=\"bb_p